      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also have a problem with it. Whenever I use my left trigger, it'll force both of my hand to be an open hand gesture and can't move at all. And I can't click on anything on VRC menu using my left trigger. But my right trigger is working just fine (Using Pico 4)\n\nHere is a video of the bug: https://youtu.be/kMS0Lu5EGhE?si=e_KnsgL_Lj6HQfw-",
