  "created": "2024-04-11T12:10:54.529Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "i use pico 4 on pcvr and often when i'm playing the htc controller starts to appear when i open my hands, and the pico controller has no layout or control scheme on pcvr (just like the standalone), sometimes it also disconfigures the controls and switches to the htc controller for no reason, to solve this i need to reapply the controls on steamvr. anyway, i wonder if this bug is in steamvr or vrchat.\n\n(Sometimes I also get the gesture of peace stuck in the avatars, and I have to restart control to resolve it)\n\n(I'd like to understand why don't bring the pico control diagrams from the standalone version to pcvr)\n\n(I opened a report on steamvr too)",
